flowchart LR
  F[Post-check failed] --> C{Change caused impact?}
  C -->|no| I[Investigate separately]
  C -->|yes| S{Rollback safe?}
  S -->|yes| R[Rollback]
  S -->|no| M[Forward remediation]
  R --> V[Revalidate]
  M --> V
  classDef action fill:#e5f7f4,stroke:#087f6d,color:#063a33,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef gate fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#b66a00,color:#5c3500,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef fail fill:#fde8e7,stroke:#c43c35,color:#5b1714,stroke-width:2px;
  class F fail; class C,S gate; class I,R,M,V action;
